  "description": "Package Avalonia apps for Windows, macOS, and Linux. Includes app signing and deployment of ready-to-install binaries to simplify distribution.\nOn .NET 10 SDK, this package shouldn't be used directly. Please install \"AvaloniaUI.Parcel\" instead.",
